OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver to face trial over
OL,4,Acrash that killed woman and four ponies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA van driver is to stand trial charged
OL,7,Fwith killing a woman in a head-on crash
OL,8,Fin Renfrewshire.
OL,10,FJames Graham allegedly struck a
OL,11,FMercedes A-Class car in which Lesley
OL,12,FJane McTear, 59, was a passenger on the
OL,13,FA737 at Howwood on 23 September 2024.
OL,15,FThe 61-year-old's legal team pled not
OL,16,Fguilty on his behalf to a charge of
OL,17,Fcausing death and serious injury by
OL,18,Fdangerous driving at the High Court in
OL,19,FGlasgow.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
