OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver to face trial over
OL,4,Acrash that killed woman and four ponies
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is claimed Graham, of Ayr, failed to
OL,7,Fspot a herd of ponies while he was
OL,8,Fdriving at 75mph - when the limit was
OL,9,F50mph - while it was dark and the
OL,10,Fvisibility was poor.
